EXPECT_OUT | ticks=47 | and-the-clear-verifies
EXPECT_HAS | $T/mp/ledger.txt | EVENT\p17\pbank\pteleport\pp1\p6,10>11,10\pfee=0;score=0 | OBSERVED-the-teleport-row-at-tick-17-in-the-Play-run-of-the-edited-level
